{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pulls/1194", "id": 529274131, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTI5Mjc0MTMx", "html_url": "https://github.com/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pull/1194", "diff_url": "https://github.com/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pull/1194.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pull/1194.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/issues/1194", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pulls/1194/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pulls/1194/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/issues/1194/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/statuses/a6876fc7773b7b691267753330626ed5e91481d2", "number": 1194, "state": "closed", "locked": true, "title": "Fixed flaky test in DiscoveryFactoryTest.java", "user": {"login": "KellyShao", "id": 24410016, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDEwMDE2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24410016?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao", "html_url": "https://github.com/KellyShao", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Fixed flaky tests with error msg related to `org.mockito.exceptions.verification.TooManyActualInvocations` that caused by \r\n `verify(runtimeContext).isDisablePeerDiscovery();` in class `com.quorum.tessera.discovery.DiscoveryFactoryTest`.\r\n\r\n- **Error msg:**\r\n    ```\r\n    org.mockito.exceptions.verification.TooManyActualInvocations: \r\n    runtimeContext.isDisablePeerDiscovery();\r\n    Wanted 1 time:\r\n    -> at com.quorum.tessera.discovery.DiscoveryFactoryTest.defaultConstructor(DiscoveryFactoryTest.java:80)\r\n    But was 2 times:\r\n    -> at com.quorum.tessera.discovery.DiscoveryFactory.provider(DiscoveryFactory.java:31)\r\n    -> at com.quorum.tessera.discovery.DiscoveryFactory.provider(DiscoveryFactory.java:31)\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n- **Root cause:**\r\nIt because this class doesn't reset the mocked objects at the very beginning, though we did reset `MockContextHolder` after each test. If we called this class right after other classes that have mocked objects unrested, there will be flaky tests.\r\n\r\nThe `org.mockito.exceptions.verification.TooManyActualInvocations` is found by running [iDFlakies](https://github.com/idflakies/iDFlakies). After fixing the issue, there's no flaky tests in `DiscoveryFactoryTest.java`", "labels": [{"id": 1005878169, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA1ODc4MTY5", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/labels/cleanup", "name": "cleanup", "description": "", "color": "ed9189", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 2698200490, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwyNjk4MjAwNDkw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Consensys-inc-archive/tessera/labels/21.1.0", "name": "21.1.0", "description": "", "color": "C8C1A6", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-11-30T04:51:03Z", "updated_at